# Visual baselines are per-GPU: a shot taken on Apple silicon does not match
# one taken on another machine's driver, so a committed baseline would fail
# for everybody who did not record it. Generate your own with
# `bun run test:visual:update` — see playwright.visual.config.ts.
e2e/visual/**/*-snapshots/

